            "cardId": "card-21j6ixmtu0k9us",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 周末的一次散步\n\n放下手机后，才听到朋友真正介意的事。\n\n值得追问：注意力也是一种投入吗？"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:8622160b",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.028Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.028Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.030Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-0tqe5amtu0k9uz",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 800,
        "y": 340,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 275,
        "headVersionId": "version-e0x5wdmtu0k9v8",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-e0x5wdmtu0k9v8",
            "cardId": "card-0tqe5amtu0k9uz",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 这次读懂了什么\n\n## 书中的线索\n关系来自投入与相处，不只是给事物贴标签。\n\n## 我的生活对照\n散步时认真听完一件小事，比急着给建议更有帮助。\n\n## 仍需保留的边界\n重视关系不等于无限承担。这个问题需要继续观察。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:d7c6ffa5",
            "origin": "ai",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.043Z",
            "sourceRunId": "run-au9e2amtu0k9v4"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.035Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.043Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-3hp950mtu0k9ys",
        "name": "这周只试一件事",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 390,
        "y": 600,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 210,
        "color": "green",
        "headVersionId": "version-sp8txwmtu0k9ys",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-sp8txwmtu0k9ys",
            "cardId": "card-3hp950mtu0k9ys",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 一个小实践\n\n约一次不看手机的散步。\n\n结束后记下：我听到了什么以前没留意的事？\n\n不是给自己的打卡任务。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:a88ea400",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.172Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.172Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.172Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "card-3ma5b1mtu0k9yv",
        "name": "周日回看｜改过一次",
        "contentKind": "markdown",
        "x": 800,
        "y": 680,
        "width": 355,
        "height": 210,
        "color": "green",
        "headVersionId": "version-um231omtu0k9z0",
        "versions": [
          {
            "id": "version-dz9j2dmtu0k9yv",
            "cardId": "card-3ma5b1mtu0k9yv",
            "sequence": 1,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 周日回看\n\n原先：只要不看手机，就算认真倾听。\n\n现在：不插话、不急着解释，也需要练习。\n\n下次先确认对方是否想听建议。"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:7feed6bb",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.175Z"
          },
          {
            "id": "version-um231omtu0k9z0",
            "cardId": "card-3ma5b1mtu0k9yv",
            "sequence": 2,
            "content": {
              "kind": "markdown",
              "markdown": "# 周日回看\n\n我原先把“专心”理解成不看手机。\n\n这次发现自己仍然很想立刻给建议。\n\n下次先问：你想让我一起想办法，还是先听你说完？"
            },
            "digest": "fnv1a:b1a8ddfa",
            "origin": "human",
            "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.180Z"
          }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2026-09-09T11:27:09.175Z",
